The Griffon Lies Heavy

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_THE_GRIFFON_LIES_HEAVY_desc]
A work that deviates from the usual style of A.K. Yearling, a masterpiece of fantasy literature, a spiritual sustenance of the resistance organization, an imperial banned book, a legend.

